{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54677","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日中晕，日被白虹穿。\n天下大兵看即（京本作「帅」）起，又兼烈士报仇冤，奋怒气冲天。\n（荆轲入秦时有此兆。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}